### Flow 1: Category QA - marketplace risk insight
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "health_beauty 类目有什么运营风险？",
  "session_id": "qa-demo"
}

### Flow 1: Category QA - another category
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "home_appliances 类目的订单主要有哪些物流和评价风险？",
  "session_id": "qa-demo"
}

### Flow 2: Order status - exact deterministic facts
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我查一下订单 203096f03d82e0dffbc41ebc2e2bcfb7 的状态",
  "session_id": "status-demo"
}

### Flow 3: Policy RAG - support policy answer
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "退款补偿能不能直接承诺？",
  "session_id": "policy-demo"
}

### Flow 4: Escalation - HITL step 1
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "订单 203096f03d82e0dffbc41ebc2e2bcfb7 延迟且低分，生成客服跟进话术",
  "session_id": "case-demo"
}

### Flow 4: Escalation - HITL step 2 confirm
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "yes",
  "session_id": "case-demo"
}

